    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/d45a9435098b6729a2c8398f228b746b.poster.avif?t=1733786955\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/d45a9435098b6729a2c8398f228b746b.webm?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/d45a9435098b6729a2c8398f228b746b.mp4?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/c6df9a9b492a57806bbc97946dfe7e66.webp?t=1733786955\" width=600 height=26 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Diverse Management Challenges </h2><br>Combine different ingredients to create a variety of vivid food and beverages, with hundreds of drink recipes, baking formulas, and cocktail mixes waiting for you to discover. <br>While serving customers, also pay attention to the needs of your feline staff so they can greet each customer with a joyful attitude. <br>In the future, we will also introduce staff recruitment and chain store management features, which means even busier days ahead! <br>Whether it\u2019s the shop environment, food and beverages, employee service, or your working cats, every aspect relies on your careful management.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/83e3aac1217e2ddcebb910ae4a33b1d3.poster.avif?t=1733786955\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/83e3aac1217e2ddcebb910ae4a33b1d3.webm?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Stealth Rescues </h2><br>Vigilance is a stray cat\u2019s creed. The night not only camouflages them but serves as your perfect disguise. <br>Transform into a heroic Cat Crusader, using the cover of darkness to undertake stealth missions in the suburbs. <br>Employ strategy and finesse to rescue the unfortunate felines, but tread lightly to avoid startling them, as scared cats can be elusive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/8f00e28767f82df2d867ae10a010ae9a.poster.avif?t=1733786955\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/8f00e28767f82df2d867ae10a010ae9a.webm?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Customization Fun </h2><br>Decorate your caf\u00e9 with a variety of furniture and d\u00e9cor to create a cozy atmosphere that attracts more cats and customers. <br>When the time is right, expand and upgrade to become the biggest cat caf\u00e9 in the city!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/670fa67679d992a9dbae5056717196a5.poster.avif?t=1733786955\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/670fa67679d992a9dbae5056717196a5.webm?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Feline Interaction </h2><br>Each cat has its own personality and preferences, from dietary habits to entertainment. <br>Mastering how to win their favor is an ongoing task. <br>Take good care of your cats and create a paradise they\u2019ll love.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/8bf9a3de0c78dcdefdb3491a8780f9ff.poster.avif?t=1733786955\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/8bf9a3de0c78dcdefdb3491a8780f9ff.webm?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Breeding Wonders </h2><br>Our unique breeding system lets you explore what adorable new life can arise from mixing different breeds and coat colors. <br>Start breeding your very own unique companions today!<br>When the cats are familiar enough with you and sufficiently mature, they will transform into Furries one night and continue to work and live with you as friends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/bec6e6e1956d836b4dd8b159edf40e50.poster.avif?t=1733786955\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/bec6e6e1956d836b4dd8b159edf40e50.webm?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><br>In &quot;CatffeeTime!&quot;, every day is filled with new opportunities and challenges, allowing you to experience the joy of management in a fun and relaxed setting. <br>So, are you ready to start your cat caf\u00e9 adventure?<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/eb89690b9fe76be60603d1ee1b0a074a.poster.avif?t=1733786955\" width=180 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/eb89690b9fe76be60603d1ee1b0a074a.webm?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/eb89690b9fe76be60603d1ee1b0a074a.mp4?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/d45a9435098b6729a2c8398f228b746b.poster.avif?t=1733786955\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/d45a9435098b6729a2c8398f228b746b.webm?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/d45a9435098b6729a2c8398f228b746b.mp4?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/c6df9a9b492a57806bbc97946dfe7e66.webp?t=1733786955\" width=600 height=26 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Diverse Management Challenges </h2><br>Combine different ingredients to create a variety of vivid food and beverages, with hundreds of drink recipes, baking formulas, and cocktail mixes waiting for you to discover. <br>While serving customers, also pay attention to the needs of your feline staff so they can greet each customer with a joyful attitude. <br>In the future, we will also introduce staff recruitment and chain store management features, which means even busier days ahead! <br>Whether it\u2019s the shop environment, food and beverages, employee service, or your working cats, every aspect relies on your careful management.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/83e3aac1217e2ddcebb910ae4a33b1d3.poster.avif?t=1733786955\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/83e3aac1217e2ddcebb910ae4a33b1d3.webm?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Stealth Rescues </h2><br>Vigilance is a stray cat\u2019s creed. The night not only camouflages them but serves as your perfect disguise. <br>Transform into a heroic Cat Crusader, using the cover of darkness to undertake stealth missions in the suburbs. <br>Employ strategy and finesse to rescue the unfortunate felines, but tread lightly to avoid startling them, as scared cats can be elusive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/8f00e28767f82df2d867ae10a010ae9a.poster.avif?t=1733786955\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/8f00e28767f82df2d867ae10a010ae9a.webm?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Customization Fun </h2><br>Decorate your caf\u00e9 with a variety of furniture and d\u00e9cor to create a cozy atmosphere that attracts more cats and customers. <br>When the time is right, expand and upgrade to become the biggest cat caf\u00e9 in the city!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/670fa67679d992a9dbae5056717196a5.poster.avif?t=1733786955\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669200/extras/670fa67679d992a9dbae5056717196a5.webm?t=1733786955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Feline Interaction </h2><br>Each cat has its own personality and preferences, from dietary habits to entertainment. <br>Mastering how to win their favor is an ongoing task. <br>Take good care of your cats and create a paradise they\u2019ll love.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video clas